\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah falls at close on spillover. \b0\par\par\uc2 570 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, July 24 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah weakened against the dollar on Thursday as regional nervousness continued to spill over into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah ended at 2,610/20 at 0910 GMT in Jakarta. The rupiah opened at 2,575/85 but fell to a low of 2,625 in the morning following a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slump in the region. \par \par \uc2  "Sentiment remains bearish and people are very cautious with the on-going \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  woes in the region," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said a report by UBS Research that the rupiah was likely to come under further pressure as the corporate sector was facing debt problems also weakened the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "There is evidence that more Indonesian corporates are facing difficulties in rolling over their maturing foreign liabilities," the report said, pointing to higher risk premiums and possibly lower credit limits because of falling investor confidence in nations with large current account deficits. \par \par \uc2  "As a result, more Indonesian corporates will have to buy rupiah and convert into foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  domestically." \par \par \uc2  "Unless supported by strong \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , this will add pressure to the rupiah." \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the rupiah plunged to a historic low of 2,665 to the dollar but recovered slightly on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  UBS said the rupiah weakness was triggered by an attack on the baht because of the perception that Thailand's rigid exchange rate regime was inconsistent with sharply dropping economic activity and high domestic interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia has a much more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system, robust economic activity and ample liquidity in the financial system, it added. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were mixed whether the sporadic uptrend of the rupiah at midday was attributable to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or to stop-loss selling of dollars in late morning. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said earlier stop-loss was triggered at the 2,590 level after local operators were forced to unload dollars to obtain rupiah due to rising swap rates. \par \par \uc2  But another dealer said there was talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  checking prices and possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move to raise overnight rates by one percentage point and the absence of short-term securities (SBPUs) purchases by Bank Indonesia helped drain excess supply of short-term liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not buy any SBPUs on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "It's a smart move from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain short-term liquidity without shocking the market. This will help prevent dollar buying with cheap rupiah," one Japanese bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its interest rates for overnight bilateral papers by one percentage point to 14.0 percent on Thursday while keeping other rates unchanged. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the move pushed short-dated swaps up, with overnight swap rising to 0.30/0.35 from -0.2/par and tom/next to 0.4/0.6 from -0.7 points. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rupiah ended at 14.0 percent. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 19.0/22.0, two at 42.0/50.0, three at 63.0/71.0 and six at 122.0/127.0 points. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the tone on the swap market remained biddish. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,378/2,682 but raised the conversion band to 2,566/2,614 on Thursday from 2,549/2,597 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7o024f6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
