\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Lower Late On Regional Bearishness \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1997\par 12:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah closed lower against the U.S. dollar in volatile dealings late Thursday on bearish sentiment over regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 2,615 rupiah in the spot market, up from Wednesday close at 2,591.50 rupiah. The dollar hit an intraday high of 2,625 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The rupiah gained some of its lost ground during the Asian trading session, especially after the Thai baht recovered against the dollar on Bank of Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But, the rupiah had to give it up when London-based participants entered the market,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling the dollar again Thursday, which helped prop the rupiah up to 2,582.50 rupiah in the spot market. But many dealers did not hear of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'It's probably only a (psychological) war launched to help the rupiah,' a dealer commented. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia refused to comment on its actions. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, did openly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the money market by draining 2.1 trillion rupiah out of the system. This was done by selling Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes. Bank Indonesia also suspended the purchase of Surat Berharga Pasar Uang - money-market notes. \par \par \uc2  As activity was still focused on the spot market, trading on the swap market was quiet Thursday, with swap rates remaining relatively stable, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia left the dollar-rupiah trading band unchanged Thursday at 2,378 rupiah-2,682 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1026GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7o05gyr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
