\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Rebounds 2.1% Late;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Confirmed \b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1997\par 11:47\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rupiah made a significant rebound versus the U.S. dollar in trading late Tuesday, buoyed by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and profit-taking from local and offshore investors, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,580 rupiah in the spot market at 0904 GMT (5:04 a.m. EDT), a 2.1% fall from Monday's close of 2,635 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The dollar has now fallen significantly back from the weak end of the rupiah's trading band, which is currently set from 2,378 rupiah to 2,682 rupiah. The market, however, is still struggling to find its own trading range, with dealers offering a wide band of 2,560 rupiah to 2,620 rupiah for near term transactions. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on in the one-month forward market to support the rupiah. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  director Djakaria told Dow Jones that Bank Indonesia wanted to see the dollar fall below the 2,600 rupiah support level. Dealers said the move was effective, eventually leading the dollar down to the 2,580 rupiah level. \par \par \uc2  Traders note that speculators are likely to take a more cautious approach toward the rupiah ahead of an Asia Pacific central bankers meeting to be held in Shanghai on Friday, July 25. Depending upon the results of the meeting, dealers say another speculative attack against the rupiah could take place - although it's doubtful. \par \par \uc2  'I personally see the market returning to the rupiah's fundamentals,' said a Singapore-based rupiah trader at a European bank. 'On this basis, the rupiah shouldn't be trading this week. I see it strengthening to the 2,500 rupiah level.' \par \par \uc2  On the swap markets, the overnight rupiah Jakarta Interbank Offered Rate moved down to around 13% from 15% earlier Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0947GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7m05aim\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
