\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  -2: Wanted To Break 2,600 Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 209 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1997\par 09:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday by selling the U.S. dollar in the one-month forward swap market. \par \par \uc2  The head of Bank Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Department, Djakaria, told Dow Jones that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was done in order to help push the dollar below its support level of 2,600 rupiah in the spot market. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar seemed to be supported at 2,600 rupiah,' Djakaria said. 'We helped the market to push the dollar down (through 2,600 rupiah). We hope the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will also calm down the market.' \par \par \uc2  Djakaria, however, declined to disclose the value of its transaction. \par \par \uc2  After closing Monday's trading at 2,635 rupiah, the dollar dipped to a low of 2,569.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0633 GMT (2:33 a.m. EDT) following Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It has since strengthened to its current level of 2,583 rupiah at 0710 GMT. \par \par \uc2  'With the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we also want to repeat our message to the market that we are not going to devalue the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Djakaria said \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0721GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7m059fq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
