\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia: Shrs End Sharply Lower; Rupiah Concerns Persist \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 1997\par 12:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--The Jakarta Stock Exchange (JSX) index ended 11.598 points, or 1.6% lower at 712.402, Monday as a wave of panic selling hit the market over the fall in the value of the rupiah versus the U.S. dollar,. \par \par \uc2  Losers lead gainers 113 to 38, with 55 stocks unchanged. Volume stood at 204 million shares valued at 394 billion rupiah, according to a local securities company. \par \par \uc2  A dealer said the sharp fall in the rupiah has hurt sentiment on the equities market. \par \par \uc2  Following the current rising trend in the dollar, some investors switched out of their stock portfolios to buy dollars. This pushed the share index to a lower close, market participants said. \par \par \uc2  'After Thailand and the Philippines, the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is under pressure,' which caused foreign fund managers to release their holdings of the rupiah and locals followed suit, another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah touched an all-time-low of 2,662.50 against the dollar at 0407 GMT (12:07 a.m. EDT) Monday. \par \par \uc2  By 0925 GMT (5:25 a.m. EDT), the rupiah stood at 2,637.50 rupiah against dollar amid rumors that \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the declining trend on the JSX index will depend on the movement of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  If the rupiah stages a recovery, the stock market could perform better Tuesday, a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Market leader PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia fell 100 rupiah to 3,925 rupiah on 3.8 million shares traded. Cement maker PT Indocement Tunggal Prakasa lost 200 rupiah at 4,250 rupiah on 2.2 million shares traded. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1007GMT \par \par \uc2  5055 55109 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7l05b43\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
