\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Plunges 5.4% Vs Dlr; Nears Weak End Of Band \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 1997\par 12:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah plunged 5.4% versus the U.S. dollar in trading Monday due to heavy selling pressure coming both from domestic corporations and offshore speculators, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Monday's plunge places the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  now less than 40 rupiah away from the weak end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, and sparked reports of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , buying rupiah in the spot and forward markets. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expect the dollar to trade higher again Tuesday as speculators test the weak end of the rupiah band which increased by one rupiah Monday to 2,378 rupiah to 2,682 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,645 rupiah in the spot market at 0912 GMT Monday (5:12 a.m. EDT), after closing Friday at 2,510 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has committed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and it appears that speculators will see if they can take them out,' said the head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealing at a European bank in Singapore. 'They have already done it in Thailand and the Philippines.' \par \par \uc2  Traders see strong support for the dollar now at 2,630 rupiah with a resistance level squarely set at the weak end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, 2,682 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's short-dated money market rates trended upwards Monday, in line with a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Overnight dollar-rupiah swap rates are at 7%, up one percentage point from Friday. One week swaps are at 7.25%, up one quarter of a percentage point. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1002GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7l05b2l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
