\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah strengthens on band speculation. \b0\par\par\uc2 582 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, July 3 (Reuter) - The rupiah strengthened against the dollar in late trading on Thursday on speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band would be widened, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the fresh speculation, which emanated from Singapore, briefly drove the rupiah below the 2,432.0 resistance level before the dollar made a rebound. \par \par \uc2  "Offshore operators seem to be trying to launch another test on the band. But the attempts were half-hearted, reflected by the quick rebound of the dollar after the fixing," one said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah settled at 2,431.75/32.25 at 0820 GMT after rising to a high of 2,430.50 from an opening of 2,433.0/33.5. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar bounced back immediately after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band unchanged at 2,427/2,619 and the conversion band at 2,427/2,475 in the afternoon fixing. \par \par \uc2  "This seems to suggest the market is not really convinced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will widen its band soon," another said. \par \par \uc2  One local bank dealer said some offshore banks tried to reduce losses arising from false positioning of the baht and the rupiah. He said some players had gone short on dollars when the rupiah was hit by worries of a baht devaluation. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah fell to a low of 2,445 on Wednesday on offshore selling on rumours of a baht devaluation. The rupiah recovered as Thailand announced a managed float policy although that was understood as a de facto devaluation by analysts. \par \par \uc2  "Although the rupiah recovered, but the losses were there," the dealer said, adding that the fresh speculation of a band widening was designed to recover some of the losses. \par \par \uc2  Today rupiah closed at 2,431.5/32.0. There was no trade in value tomorrow due to a public holiday in the United States on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said increased speculation of a widening was due to the Consultative Group for Indonesia (CGI) donor meeting in Tokyo later this month chaired by the World Bank. \par \par \uc2  The bank said in a report on \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month that some countries had a wider \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band but did not specifically suggest that Jakarta follow suit. \par \par \uc2  But \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sudradjad Djiwandono said it was not good sense to follow what other people were doing. \par \par \uc2  "This kind of argument is weak. That is not good economic policy that just because other poeple have 15 percent we have to go to 15 percent," Djiwandono said. \par \par \uc2  One \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst said he did not expect a band widening in the near term because it would appreciate the rupiah and thus be counter-productive to the sluggish export recovery. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not want to be made responsible for the country's export performance due to its exchange rate policy while the rupiah was not under heavy pressure for an immediate fine-tuning. \par \par \uc2  One European bank dealer explained strong rupiah support from the stock market point of view. He said portfolio inflows had also put pressure on the dollar as reflected by the stock market index which has hit three new highs this week. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 1.75/1.85 and spot/next at 0.27/0.33. \par \par \uc2  One-month swaps were at 12.25/12.75, two at 25.5/27.0, three at 38.0/39.0 and six at 79.5/80.5 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt73031q8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
