\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah eases on liquidity, trade slow. \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, June 30 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah eased against the dollar in early trading on Monday on the back of generally ample liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One foreign bank dealer said trading was slow due to a lack of fresh market factors. \par \par \uc2  "The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to remain moving in a tight range the rest of the day due to a lack of fresh market factors," another bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was at 2,431.30/31.80 at 0320 GMT against an opening of 2,430.50/31.50. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were at 2,431.00/31.70 and 2,431.00/31.50, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the spot rupiah rate was likely to range between 2,431.00 to 2,432.00 the rest of the day. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.20/0.25 while tom/next was at 0.12/0.16 points. \par \par \uc2  One-month swaps were at 13.50/14.25, two at 26.50/27.50, three at 41.50/42.50 and six at 84.25/85.00 points. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,425/2,617 and its conversion band at 2,425/2,473 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6u034wc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
