\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah volatile on band and politics. \b0\par\par\uc2 351 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 April 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, April 23 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah was volatile against the dollar in moderate trading at midday on Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the rupiah strengthened at mid-morning following a report in a local daily quoting a university professor and an unnamed official as saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was planning a band widening in the near future. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah rose to a high of 2,417.5 from an opening of 2,418.5/19.5 on the back of the report, but was later ignored by the market as operators switched focus to politics. \par \par \uc2  A noted economist said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely to widen its band in the short- or medium-term because there was no fundamental reason to back it up at present. \par \par \uc2  "The rate is hovering at a healthy level below the mid-rate of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band and moderately higher than the floor rate. I don't see any reason to act now," the economist said. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had implemented a new reserve rate of five percent only last week which should help contain money supply growth, which exceeded the government target in 1996. \par \par \uc2  The economist said there was no immediate reason to act and the effect of the new reserve rate had to be digested first. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, operators switched focus to political issues as the campaign for general elections on May 29 will start Sunday. \par \par \uc2  One \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer in Singapore said the tone had turned biddish for the dollar after the lunch-break. \par \par \uc2  "Political issues are taking the lead for now. People are worried over possible riots and things like that as we enter the campaign period," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah weakened to 2,420.0/21.0 at 0545 GMT. \par \par \uc2  One local bank dealer said there could be more upside for the dollar after it broke the resistance level of 2,420.0. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one point to 2,403/2,595 and the conversion band at 2,403/2,451 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt4n06pz0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
