\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Flat Early; Looking For  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Move \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 05:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is virtually flat versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Friday as market players remain sidelined in anticipation over whether Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , will increase the lower-end of its trading band Friday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,405.75 rupiah in the spot market at 0400 GMT (11 p.m. EST), after starting the day at 2,405.87 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Traders see the dollar trading in a range between 2,404 rupiah and 2,406 rupiah through the rest of Friday. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity concerns are not an issue in the market, a dealer said, as the amount of rupiah in the system is ample. \par \par \uc2  Dealers did say that there is some confusion in the market over whether Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will increase the lower-end of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band Friday as it did Thursday. A move to increase the lower-end of the dollar will strengthen the U.S. dollar against the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The market is waiting for a sign from Bank Indonesia of which direction it wants the market headed,' said Pardy Kandi, chief dealer at PT Mitsubishi Bank Buana in Jakarta. 'Until that time most will stay sidelined.' \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia is expected to announce whether the band will increase around 0800 GMT Friday. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday increased the lower end of its rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one rupiah to 2,389 rupiah-2,581 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-03-97 \par \par \uc2  0438GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3l0231q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
