\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah weakens on ample supply. \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, March 10 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah weakened against the dollar in slow late trading on Monday due to sustained ample liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "We had already expected the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken further in late trading as rupiah liquidity remained ample," one foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last quoted at 2,396.00/96.40 at 0830 GMT against 2,395.25/96.00 at the opening. Tomorrow and today rupiah were at 2,395.90/95.35 and 2,395.15/95.50 respectively. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the rupiah was expected to remain weak on Tuesday as the ample liquidity was likely to continue. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said short-term and longer-term swaps had generally eased on ample rupiah supply. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was quoted at par/0.05, down from 0.10/0.20 at the opening and tom/next fell to 0.05/0.07 from an opening of 0.10/0.20. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank Indonesia governor's announcement to sell the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stakes in several commercial banks had more impact on the local stock exchange than on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  One-month swaps were at 10.00/10.50, two at 23.0/24.00, three at 36.00/36.50 and six at 75.0/76.00 points. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one point to 2,386/2,578 and the conversion band also by one point to 2,386/2,434 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3a08wxs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict