\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Strengthens Vs Dlr; Liquidity Tightens \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 1997\par 05:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah has strengthened considerably versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Friday as tightened liquidity has brought many players back into rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,369.80 rupiah in the spot market at 0405 GMT Friday, after starting the day at 2,375 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Traders see the dollar trading in a range between 2,368 rupiah and 2,372 rupiah through the rest of Friday. \par \par \uc2  Market players cite the covering of short dollar position earlier in the week for driving the dollar up to unusually high levels. \par \par \uc2  Many dealers had been speculating that Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was preparing to widen its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band. When the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't make the move, many were caught short dollars. \par \par \uc2  With the short-covering finishing and Indonesia's money market tightening, most see the dollar weakening to the lower-end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  early Friday left unchanged its dollar-rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,366 rupiah - 2,558 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The rupiah will either remain where it is and wait to meet the lower-end of the band as it increases, or the dollar could start moving back down itself,' said a Singapore-based dealer at a European bank. 'Either way the dollar will be back at the strong-end of the band.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0421GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1h00a9m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
