\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah -2: 1.786 Trln Rupiah Injected In Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 166 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1997\par 06:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band to 8% from 3% in 1996 and some economists predicted the band could be widened to as much as 15%. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that it wants to transfer to the market as much as possible the task of guiding the rupiah's value. By widening the band, greater \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk is incurred by market players, the bank has said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , early Monday injected 1.768 trillion rupiah into the money market system, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The expiration of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI), Bank Indonesia's certificates, added 1.966 trillion rupiah into the system, but the expiration of Surat Berharga Pasar Uang (SBPU), money market certificates, absorbed 198 billion rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  early Monday left unchanged its dollar-rupiah exchange rate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,363 rupiah - 2,555 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0501GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1d009q0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
