\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Dn Vs. Dlr; Increased Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1997\par 05:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is down versus the U.S. dollar in quiet trading early Monday due to increased liquidity in the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The swap market, however, was active due to Friday's sell-off of U.S. dollars due to rumors that Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was preparing to widen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  Short-dated contracts came down significantly Monday morning on expectations that Bank Indonesia will continue to flood the market with rupiah to drive down the rupiah's value. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar is being bought at 2,364 rupiah in the spot market at 0417 GMT Monday, after closing Friday at 2,362.85 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rupiah Jakarta Interbank Offered Rate (JIBOR) early Monday fell to around 8%, while the premium of the overnight dollar-rupiah swaps fell to par, which is equal to a 5.5% interest rate. \par \par \uc2  Traders now see the dollar trading in a tight range between 2,363.50 rupiah and 2,364.50 rupiah through the rest of Monday. \par \par \uc2  'We saw pressure on the downside in the swap market on expectations of increased liquidity (in rupiah) in the market,' said Pardi Kendy of Bank of America in Jakarta. 'Rumors of the band widening have largely cooled down, however.' \par \par \uc2  Speculation that Bank Indonesia was moving to widen the band caused the rupiah to strengthen considerably Friday, down to the point where it actually was below the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not, however, make any adjustments in the band Friday. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not want to bow to the market,' Pardi said. 'They'll probably wait until the rumors die down before announcing a widening.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0453GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1d009of\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
