\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Closes Flat Vs Dlr; Band Unchanged \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 1997\par 11:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah closed flat at the 2,363-rupiah level in Jakarta's spot market against the U.S. dollar in volatile dealings Friday as Bank Indonesia left the trading band unwidened, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded below the lower end of the trading band set by bank Indonesia at 2,363 rupiah on speculation from overseas players that Bank Indonesia would widen the band in the day. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell to an intraday low of 2,360.25 rupiah, with the most active trading spotted taking place at 2,362.50 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Unyielding to the speculation, Bank Indonesia, however, maintained the trading band at 2,363 rupiah and 2,555 rupiah Friday. It propelled the dollar higher. \par \par \uc2  Although the dollar had fallen below the trading band, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the dollar, an official with bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  ``It (the dollar's slumping) was triggered by band-widening speculation. We did nothing (to support the dollar) as we have never signaled any band widening,'' the official told Ap-Dow Jones. \par \par \uc2  Although Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, it opened its door for banks who wanted to sell the dollar to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated around $1 billion were sold to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  between 0800 GMT and 0900 GMT Friday, the time when Bank Indonesia open its door for dollar sellers. \par \par \uc2  The official, however, declined to confirm the amount. ``The amount was large,'' he only said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1002GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1a005wz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
