\par\par \b \uc2  Speculation on Indonesia's rupiah band continues. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mantik Kusjanto \par \uc2 486 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Jan 10 (Reuter) - Speculation on another widening of the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar-rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band lifted the rupiah against the dollar in volatile Friday trading, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said many operators shrugged off the speculation but offshore fund managers kept unloading dollars which led some players to believe a widening was imminent. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sudradjad Djiwandono was close-mouthed on the issue when he met reporters and bankers this week. \par \par \uc2  "Our monetary policy is eclectic and pragmatic. We keep adjusting whenever it is necessary. But I can't say when it's necessary," he said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "Our policy is flexible. I can't take the mystery out from the market," he added. \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah exchange rate will be maintained at a realistic level without anti-export bias," Djiwandono told bankers at an annual bankers' dinner hosted by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  A state bank economist said the governor's explicit comments were sufficient to indicate an imminent widening was unlikely. \par \par \uc2  "A band widening now would strengthen the rupiah further which is then violating the export policy," the economist said. \par \par \uc2  Market analysts said, however, that "creative \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  players" had spread rumours. Market talk had ranged from a band widening on Friday afternoon, to imminent action because the bank was holding a meeting, and a news conference had been called. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  denied any meeting was in progress or that a news conference was planned. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah, meanwhile, continued to appreciate. \par \par \uc2  It surged to a high of 2,359.0 to the dollar at midday, four points outside of the Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 2,363/2,555 set on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stabilise the rupiah if the dollar-rupiah rate moves outside of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, which is set by the bank on a daily basis. Many \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers in Jakarta said they did not believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would bow to market pressure. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also noted that shrinking interest rate differentials between the dollar and the rupiah, due to declining Indonesian inflation, suggested the potential for a narrowing of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had also said short-term capital inflows of less than one year, accounted for only five percent of the total capital inflow of $10.5 billion in 1996. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said rumours of a band widening had been in the market since October after \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were caught by surprise by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's unexpected move in September. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia widened the band to eight percent from five percent on September 11, after widening it to five percent from three percent on June 13. \par \par \uc2  Since then, dealers have consistently speculated on another widening because of sustained capital inflows, due to interest rate differentials between the dollar and the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt1a07xck\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
