\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah little changed in late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 397 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Jan 6 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah was little changed against the dollar in dull late trading on Monday, with sentiment seen remaining firm on the rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One Japanese bank dealer said pressure on the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained despite sustained ample liquidity in the money market. \par \par \uc2  He said operators would like to go long on dollars because of prevailing cheap swap rates, but fears over a possible band widening prevented broad dollars buying. \par \par \uc2  "The profit is clearly there if people dare to go long on dollars. Roll-over costs are pretty cheap," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.15/0.25 and tom/next at 0.23/0.28. \par \par \uc2  But there was still speculation in the market that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might widen its band again, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not response to market speculation and depreciated the rupiah by another point on Monday although the dollar-rupiah rate was trading at its lower band. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one point to 2,362/2,554 and the conversion rate to 2,362/2,410. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market seemed to shrug off the 1997/78 budget which was unveiled on Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  They said the focus now was the band although some concerns were seen on a widening of the current account deficit. \par \par \uc2  Andrew Fung, regional treasury economist at Standard Chartered Bank in Singapore, said the budget was likely to support investor confidence in Indonesia as it showed the government was maintaining responsible policies. \par \par \uc2  But he said it would have little impact on the rupiah since \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets were mainly focused on the band. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said operators kept selling swaps which pushed them to a level where many operators believed they have been oversold. \par \par \uc2  However, pressure was still there because of the ample rupiah supply, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 12.00/12.75, two at 23.00/24.00, three at 35.00/36.00 and six at 75.0/75.5 points. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was at 2,362.0/62.1 at 0920 GMT against an opening of 2,361.80/62.80. Tomorrow and today rupiah closed at 2,361.60/61.90 and 2,361.25/61.75, respectively. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dt1604k8y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
