d today rupiah were last quoted at 2,354.35/53.65 and 2,353.75/54.25, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one point to 2,354/2,546 and the conversion band also by one point to 2,354/2,402 late on Wednesday. -- Jakarta +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dscj01xh0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
