\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah stable in thin late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 18 (Reuter) - Indonesia's rupiah was stable against the dollar in thin late trading on Wednesday amid ample liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Some small banks were seen buying rupiah to cover their position for year-end needs, but there was not much impact on the rupiah which is already hovering at the lower end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fixing band," one local bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the sufficient market liquidity also helped keep the rupiah spot rate stable despite some local buying. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last quoted at 2,353.90/54.00 against an opening of 2,353.50/54.50. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said earlier anticipation of an increase in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fixing rates had also kept the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable despite the local rupiah buying. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one point to 2,354/2,546 and the conversion band at 2,354/2,402 late on Wednesday as anticipated, in line with its current policy of raising the bands by three to four points per week. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 16.00/16.50, two at 30.00/31.50, three at 43.50/45.00. Six-months swap was last at 87.00/88.00 points. \par \par \uc2  The foreign bank dealer said the spot rupiah rate was likely to range between 2,354.00 and 2,354.50 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was last at 0.45/0.55 from an opening of 0.50/0.60. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were last quoted at 2,353.00/53.45 and 2,353.50/54.50, respectively. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-63