\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah steady amid sufficient liquidity. \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 17 (Reuter) - Indonesia's rupiah remained steady against the dollar in slow late trading on Tuesday amid sufficient liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Overseas dollar selling was noted after the lunch break which helped keep sentiment on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  steady despite sufficient market liquidity," one foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said weekly tax-payments and earlier anticipation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not likely to increase the fixing rate later on Tuesday also kept sentiment steady. \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, said trading volume was thin due to the holiday mood ahead of year-end. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 16.00/16.25, two at 30.00/31.00, three at 42.50/43.25 and six at 86.50/87.50 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,353/2,545 and the conversion band at 2,353/2,401 late on Tuesday as anticipated earlier. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last quoted at 2,353.25/53.50 against an opening of 2,353.00/54.00. \par \par \uc2  The foreign bank dealer said the spot rupiah rate was likely to range between 2,353.50 and 2,354.50 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  He said overnight swap edged up to 0.60/0.70 from an opening of 0.40/0.50 following the weekly tax-payments. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were last quoted at 2,353.25/53.60 and 2,352.00/53.00, respectively. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dsch026iv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscale