\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah little changed in late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 16 (Reuter) - Indonesia's rupiah was little changed against the dollar in late trading on Monday amid ample rupiah liquidity and a further rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fixing rate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "There is not much happening in the market today. The rupiah remained little changed despite the fact that the market has become more liquid in late trading," a dealer from a large privately-owned local bank said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained little changed after the raising of the fixing rate as it had been expected. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one point to 2,353/2,545 rupiah and the conversion band to 2,353/2,401 late on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Another foreign dealer said some overseas rupiah selling was noted after the lunch break, possibly due to profit-taking or dealers taking a covering position ahead of the year-end. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last quoted at 2,353.30/53.50 against an opening of 2,353.50/54.00. \par \par \uc2  He said tom/next was also little changed, despite weekly tax-payments on Tuesday, as liquidity was expected to remain adequate tommorow. \par \par \uc2  The local bank dealer said the spot rupiah rate was likely to range between 2,353.00 and 2,354.00 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were last quoted at 2,352.90/53.00 and 2,352.10/52.35, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was last at 0.45/0.55, tom/next was at 0.42/0.50. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 16.00/16.50, two at 28.75/31.00, three at 41.50/42.50 and six at 85.75/86.50 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dscg029bj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
