\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah firms on tight liquidity. \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 13 (Reuter) - Indonesia's rupiah remained firm against the dollar in moderate late trading on Friday on the back of continued tight market liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One bank dealer said state-owned banks appeared to have been active in the market, pushing the overnight swap rate higher. \par \par \uc2  "State-owned banks were seen actively trading short-term swaps, particularly overnight swaps, due to weekly tax payments and the end of reporting period," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer, however, said the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's upward trend was limited due to earlier speculation of a higher fixing rate later on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. bank dealer said the spot rupiah rate was likely to range between 2,353.00 and 2,354.00 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last quoted at 2,353.20/53.50 against an opening of 2,354.00/54.25. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were last quoted at 2,352.95/53.05 and 2,350.95/51.75, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by another one point to 2,352/2,544 and the conversion band to 2,352/2,400 late on Friday as anticipated earlier. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had previously increased the fixing rate by three points this week. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was last at 1.85/1.95 from an opening of 1.50/1.60 while tom/next was last at 0.45/0.55 against an opening of 0.40/0.48. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 14.50/15.50, two at 30.25/31.00, three at 43.00/43.75 and six at 86.00/87.00 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2