\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah stable in slow late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 11 (Reuter) - Indonesia's rupiah was stable against the dollar in slow late trading on Wednesday on the back of adequate money market liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One Japanese bank dealer said long-term swap rates remained generally stable in slow trading while some local buying of spot rupiah was seen ahead of tax payments on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "The swap rates remain generally stable. There was some local rupiah buying ahead of tax payments on Friday, but they failed to boost sentiment on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," another foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was quoted at 2,351.75/52.20 in late trading against an opening of 2,351.50/52.0. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were quoted at 2,351.25/51.65 and 2,351.0/51.30, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise its fixing rate on Thursday following increases on Monday and Tuesday. It did not increase the fixing rate today. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has maintained a three-to-four-point rupiah depreciation a week since late September. \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah is likely to move in a narrow range in trading on Thursday, with spot rupiah seen between 2,351.50/52.50," the Japanese bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.50/0.60 and tom/next at 0.43/0.48. \par \par \uc2  One-month swaps was at 15.00/15.50, two at 29.50/31.00, three at 42.75/43.75 and six at 87.00/87.50 points. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,350/2,542 and the conversion band to 2,350/2,398. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dscb02bxi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
