\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah little changed in quiet trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 330 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Nov 18 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah was little changed against the dollar in late trading on Monday, with some pressure seen on swap rates, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said overall trading was very quiet, with players seen staying mainly on the sidelines. \par \par \uc2  "There is barely any volume. We just go with the market. We do not really want to do much," one U.S. bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "We have enough profits for this year," another said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they would prefer to stay on the sidelines unless something really fundamental happened. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was at 2,337.0/37.2 at 0830 GMT against an opening of 2,336.5/37.5. Tomorrow and today rupiah closed at 2,336.5/37.0 and 2,336.25/36.5, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a higher \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixing did not surprise the market as it had been widely anticipated. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one point to 2,337/2,529 and the conversion rate to 2,337/2,385 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has depreciated the rupiah by 16 points in the past five weeks. \par \par \uc2  One Japanese bank dealer said the higher fixing and ample rupiah supply did not affect sentiment on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. bank dealer said ample liquidity seemed to put some pressure on the swap market, especially in three-month swap which eased to 48 points. \par \par \uc2  He said operators were also anticipating some declines of domestic interest rates next year which seemed to have extended pressure on longer-term swap rates. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money was last at 9.5 percent. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.30/0.35 and tom/next at 0.35/0.39. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 15.00/15.25, two at 32.0/33.0, three at 47.5/48.0 and six at 92.0/94.0 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsbi00910\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
