\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah little changed in late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Oct 28 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah was little changed against the dollar in quiet late trading on Monday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The market is very quiet today. Overseas operators remain slow, while volume is thin due to a lack of fresh leads," one European bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to raise the fixing rate by one point in late afternoon did not have much impact on the market. \par \par \uc2  "The new fixing does not have much impact as the raise had been expected," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one point to 2,327/2,519 and the conversion rate to 2,327/2,375 late on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar-rupiah rate was expected to range between 2,326.75 and 2,327.5 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  They said rupiah liquidity was relatively ample with slow demand. \par \par \uc2  Demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, was likely to increase due to month-end factors in the coming days, they said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was at 2,327.10/27.30, compared with an opening of 2,326.5/27.25. Tomorrow and today were at 2,326.55/26.80 and 2,325.80/26.25, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.25/0.30 and tom/next at 0.40/0.45. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 16.00/16.75, two at 33.20/33.50, three at 49.75/50.50 and six at 97.00/98.00 points. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsas012b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pich