\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia 's Rupiah Dn Vs. Dlr; Mkt Wary of Trading Band \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 1996\par 06:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is down versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Tuesday as dealers remain wary of the lower-end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  early Tuesday left unchanged its dollar-rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,324 rupiah - 2,516 rupiah, leaving the dollar less than one rupiah above the lower-end of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted, however, that while the dollar is seen supported at this level, it is unlikely that it will edge higher as the rupiah's high yields remain too attractive. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is being bought at 2,324.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0316 GMT Tuesday, after starting the day at 2,324 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Traders see the dollar trading in a range between 2,324 rupiah and 2,325 rupiah through the rest of Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  ``The market is just waiting for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise the lower end of the band to 2,325,'' said a dealer at Bank of America. ``This is why the dollar is pretty much stuck at its current levels.'' \par \par \uc2  Most dealers agree, however, that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will probably wait until Wednesday to make its move. \par \par \uc2  Currently, the three-month dollar rupiah deposit is yielding nearly 15.5%, considerably higher than eurodollar deposits, which are steady at around 5.5%, traders noted. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-10-96 \par \par \uc2  0436GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsam008et\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
