\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Dn Vs Dlr; Increase In Band Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1996\par 06:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is down versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Tuesday as market players bought dollars in anticipation of Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , increasing the lower-end of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band by one, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Market players have also been buying dollars in expectation of a fall in swap rates as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  moved Monday to increase rupiah liquidity. They note, however, that the fall has not materialized. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,320.98 rupiah in the spot market at 0340 GMT, after starting the day at 2,320.50 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Traders see the dollar trading in a range between 2,320.50 rupiah and 2,321.50 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Singapore has been in the lead in buying dollars,' noted Trisiladi Supriyanto, a dealer at Bank of America. 'They are growing uneasy by the closeness of the lower-end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  band.' \par \par \uc2  Currently, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has left unchanged its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,320 rupiah to 2,501 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  With the dollar trading at less than the one rupiah above the lower-end of the band, however, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seen increasing the band to 2,321 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Also, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying dollars and flooding the market with rupiah, many market players expected swap rates to fall. Dealers note, however, that the rates remain high. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rupiah Jakarta Interbank Offered Rate (JIBOR) early Tuesday was steady between 15% and 16%, nearly the same level Monday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The premium of the overnight dollar-rupiah swap also remained high at around 16%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-10-96 \par \par \uc2  0401GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsaf000q3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
