\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia rupiah steady, back to  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  band. \b0\par\par\uc2 520 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Oct 10 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah was steady against the dollar in moderate early trading on Thursday, with the rupiah returning to within the parameters of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, dealers said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers in Jakarta said offshore players, mainly from Singapore, were seen trying to create ground for a band widening as they continued to unload dollars in an attempt to strengthen the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  But the dealers said it was unlikely that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would widen again in the short-term as the band was widened just last September to eight percent from five percent. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would widen its band again at present," one economist attached to a state bank said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said offshore players were also seen trying to link a meeting between the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and some bank directors on Thursday to a possible announcement of a band widening. \par \par \uc2  The meeting, scheduled for the afternoon, was a regular meeting between the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and some selective banks to exchange information on recent market developments, banking sources in Jakarta said. \par \par \uc2  "No decision will be made at the meeting," the economist said, adding that it was not a policy-making meeting. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said offshore players were trying to create reasons to sell dollars and also to challenge the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think Bank Indonesia would give in to offshore pressure," he said. \par \par \uc2  Offshore operators started testing the band late on Wednesday, raising the rupiah out of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ceiling after the official squaring time at 0900 GMT. \par \par \uc2  But state bank dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , leaving the rupiah trading at 2,318.25 against the dollar in London. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah returned to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band in early Thursday trading at 2,320.5/21.0 at the opening after factoring in some premiums for longer days. \par \par \uc2  Spot value on Thursday will be due next Tuesday because of a public holiday in the United States on Monday. Spot rupiah was quoted at 2,320.4/20.5 at 0305 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were quoted at 2,316.75/17.25 and 2,316.25/16.75, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said sentiment on the rupiah remained firm. \par \par \uc2  They said it was not clear why offshore players tried to spread rumours for another widening. \par \par \uc2  They said short-dated swaps were still expensive on foreign buying, which also kept longer-term rates high. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.60/0.65. Tom/next swap rose to 3.3/3.6 points from 2.75/3.0 points at the opening. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was quoted at 18.5/19.5, two at 35.0/36.5, three at 53.0/55.0 and six at 102.5/104.5 points. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one point to 2,319/2,511 and the conversion rate also by one point to 2,319/2,367 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsaa01z1l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
