\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Up Vs. Dollar On Attractive Yields \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Oktober 1996\par 06:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is higher versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Wednesday as interest in the rupiah's yields has forced the dollar closer to the lower end of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Market watchers also note that the conviction of some traders that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would widen its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band - to 10% from its current level of 8% - if the dollar breached the lower-end of the band have made them particularly aggressive. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,320.25 rupiah in the spot market at 0419 GMT Wednesday, after starting the day at 2,320.75 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The dollar, however, hit an intraday low of 2,319.25 rupiah at 0142 GMT, placing it just about one rupiah above lower-end of the band. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  early Wednesday left unchanged its dollar-rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,318 rupiah - 2,510 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The swap rates are still so attractive that it is difficult not to sell dollars for rupiah,' noted a Singapore-based dealer at a Western bank. 'It is expensive not to.' \par \par \uc2  The overnight rupiah Jakarta Interbank Offered Rate (JIBOR) early Wednesday was steady at 15% from the same level Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The premium of the overnight dollar-rupiah swaps was steady early Wednesday at 0.70-0.80 from the same level Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-10-96 \p