\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah firms in dull late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Sept 23 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah firmed against the dollar in late trading on Monday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said overall volume was thin on lack of fresh leads. \par \par \uc2  "There was no drive in the market. The rate was hovering in such a narrow range that it's difficult to make profits," one Japanese bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was at 2,318.0/19.0 at 0845 GMT, compared with an opening of 2,319.0/20.0. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said liquidity was ample in the afternoon, but the tom/next swap rate edged up. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese dealer said it might be due to speculation of tight liquidity on Tuesday for weekly tax payments. \par \par \uc2  "But I don't think liquidity would be tight because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has offered one to three-day overnight papers (SBIs) to the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  He said this should help stabilise Tuesday's rupiah market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said sentiment on the rupiah remained strong and expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ceiling. \par \par \uc2  Another foreign bank dealer said the dollar-rupiah rate was expected to range between 2,318 and 2,320 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah closed at 2,317.5/18.0 and 2,318.5/19.0, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said longer-term swap rates eased slightly on the back of relatively ample liquidity in the money market. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money was last at 9.5 percent. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was last at 14.75/15.25, two at 30.25/31.00, three at 46.75/47.00 and six at 95.00/96.50 points. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one point to 2,313/2,505 and the conversion rate also by one point to 2,313/2,361 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds9n02v66\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
