\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah edges up in dull late trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Sept 17 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah edged up against the dollar in dull late trading on Tuesday on the back of sustained bullish sentiment, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One local bank dealer said Singapore operators were forced to unload dollars they bought earlier because of fresh selling from Hong Kong and London operators. \par \par \uc2  "They might have to cut losses as fund managers needed the rupiah to pay for stock purchases," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there were some customer orders to sell dollars following a rebound of the Jakarta stock market, which was later carried forward by London operators. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah edged up to 2,321.00/21.50 at 0850 GMT from an opening of 2,322.5/23.0. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah closed at 2,320.65/21.00 and 2,320.50/20.75, respectively. \par \par \uc2  "Sentiment on the rupiah remains bullish. There are still some selling pressures in the market for dollars, but I think the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be well supported at the 2,320.0 level," the local bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said operators were reluctant to sell dollars aggressiveley at the present level because it now was trading at the lower end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's floor rate. \par \par \uc2  One said the dollar-rupiah rate was expected to range between 2,320.0 and 2,323.0 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The local bank dealer said swap rates were relatively stable in the afternoon after edging up earlier on the back of some uptrend in the interbank money market. \par \par \uc2  "People were still worried about last Friday's condition. They kept a close watch on the overnight rate," he said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said liquidity was sufficient late in the afternoon, with overnight money trading at around 14.0 percent. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.5/0.6 and tom/next at 0.50/0.58. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said tom/next rate was relatively expensive, reflecting some underlying concern over the liquidity outlook. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was quoted 15.25/16.00, two at 30.25/31.25, three at 47.25/47.75 and six at 96.50/97.50 points. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 2,310/2,502 and the conversion rate at 2,310/2,358 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds9h02wer\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
