\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Dn Vs. Dlr On Short-Covering By Locals \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 1996\par 05:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is down versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Monday as local dealers covered short-dollar positions, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said that improved liquidity in the system has lent support to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Market players say, however, that the upside for the dollar should be capped due to tax-payment deadlines Tuesday and Wednesday in Indonesia. These deadlines increase demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,323.75 rupiah in the spot market at 0333 GMT Friday after starting the day at 2,323.12 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  With mixed sentiment dictating the market, traders see the dollar trading in a range between 2,323 rupiah and 2,328 rupiah through the rest of Monday. \par \par \uc2  'I'm expecting tight ranges today because despite some short-covering there really aren't many reasons for selling the rupiah,' said the head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a Western bank. 'Tax-payments should begin tomorrow in the manufacturing sector, which should give support to the rupiah.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers say that the market players are slowly growing accustomed to the new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band introduced last week by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The band was widened to 8% from 5%. \par \par \uc2  Strong support for the dollar is now seen at the 2,323-rupiah level for the rest of the week, with the upside capped at 2,330 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Only renewed political concerns could cause the dollar to spike higher, dealers said. But without any major events predicted, the environment seems calm. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-09-96 \par \par \uc2  0341GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds9g07gdt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
