\par\par \b \uc2  Rupiah jumps after Indonesia's surprise move. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mantik Kusjanto \par \uc2 509 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 1996\par 12:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Sept 11 (Reuter) - The rupiah rose sharply against the dollar on Wednesday after \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  suprised the market and widened its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band for the second time this year. \par \par \uc2  The widening effectively gives the market more flexibility to set its own rate, a move which met with approval as the rupiah soared against the dollar immediately after the announcement. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah soared to a high of 2,326.0 against the dollar by midday, compared with an opening of 2,348.50/49.50. At 0919 GMT, it was quoted at 2,329.00/31.00 \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was fixed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 2,309/2,501 rupiah against the dollar on Wednesday against 2,344.0/2,462.0 on Tuesday, or a spread of eight percent against five percent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement obtained by Reuters that the move was in line with policies to contain a overheating economy, to reduce speculative trading, to strengthen the ability of the bank to control \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations and to give more solid ground for monetary control. \par \par \uc2  The band, fixed daily by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sets the limits outside of which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "The timing caught the market by surprise," Edwin Png, country treasurer of Bank of America, told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "It shows that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the determination to let the market decide what is the right level of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  He added that that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quite encouraged by the last move since the market had been trading within the band. Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  last widened its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band in June this year to five percent from three percent after the rupiah came under persistent upward pressure. \par \par \uc2  "I think the market is mature enough to accept this. The market is pretty professional in that there was not much panic after the announcement," Png said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said Wednesday's rise was in line with gains after previous widenings of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. They said prevailing market sentiment that the rupiah was a high-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also helped the gains. \par \par \uc2  Png said the rupiah was likely to remain strong until the end of the year because of its attractive yield compared with Thailand's baht or other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also announced that that banks' minimum reserve requirement ratio would be increased to five percent from three percent, effective April 16, 1997. \par \par \uc2  The reserve requirement is the amount of deposits banks must place with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Bank Indonesia last raised its reserve requirement to three percent from two percent in February. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said all other existing reserve requirements would remain unchanged, including calculations and reporting methods. \par \par \uc2  It said the increase in the reserve ratio and the widening of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band would enable the government to contain loan growth and overall liquidity in the market as well as increase the effectiveness of monetary management. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds9b0365a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
