\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia central bank \highlight\uc2  widens  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  band. \b0\par\par\uc2 182 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Sept 11 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it will widen its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band to eight percent from five percent effective immediately. \par \par \uc2  It said also in a statement that the minimum reserve requirement ratio of banks will be raised to five percent from three percent effective from April 16, 1997. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement obtained by Reuters the move was in line with the policy to contain the overheating economy, to reduce speculative trading in financial markets and to strengthen the ability of the bank to control \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is scheduled to announce the new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at around 0800 GMT. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band allows the bank to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when market rates move out of the band that the bank fixes on a daily basis. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band last in June this year to five percent from three percent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate on Tuesday was at 2,344.0/2,462.0. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par